{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Six days you shall labor and do all your work.</b> He says: all six days it is possible for you to serve HaShem, blessed be He, along with doing all your work — in the manner of the patriarchs, who would serve the Blessed Name along with the work of livestock and other physical pursuits; but the seventh day, all of it, shall be to YHWH your Elohim — you shall do no work in it at all. This I heard in the name of the Rambam, z\"l."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:01:30.398647925Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}